# Route: guide 14 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to
# 36, 35 quests, 4.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Thousand Needles, The Barrens, Orgrimmar, Alterac
# Mountains): Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Theramore Isle ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill ->
# Brackenwall Village -> The Shimmering Flats -> Freewind Post -> Ratchet ->
# The Crossroads -> The Forgotten Pools -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 6607 Nat Pagle,
# Angler Extreme; 7321 Soothing Turtle Bisque.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), Gahz'rilla (2770), Willix the
# Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate
# Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981),
# Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The
# Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the Lost Satchel
# (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying the Beast
# (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697), Changing Tastes
# (95697), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight (96986),
# Opportunistic Education (96987).

